{
  "$comment": [
    "Turn 产物汇总的共享期望值。sidecar(TypeScript) 与 Daemon(Rust) 两侧的测试都读这一份,",
    "它是「什么算正确」的唯一定义处 —— 任何一侧的测试都不得自己写死期望数字。",
    "",
    "使用约定:",
    "1. 新增用例先于改实现。要扩展覆盖时,先在这里加用例(此时测试应为红),再改两侧实现让它变绿。",
    "2. 每个逻辑操作都要问一次「另一条来源长什么样」。工具事件有三条来源:实时、原生会话同步、",
    "   库内既有时间线。同步来源保留上游原始拼写与大小写、且一律没有变更前快照。",
    "3. lineCases 要求两端逐字节一致;eventCases 只断言可观察的产物条目,不断言实现细节。",
    "4. 分三层:lineCases(行数语义)、eventCases(单轮之内的折算)、sessionCases(整段会话产出几张卡片)。",
    "   只在一段会话被整体加载时才成立的规则(例如「库里已有产物事件的轮次不得再补一张」)",
    "   只能放进 sessionCases —— 单轮用例表达不了它,而它恰恰是最容易在真实库上出问题的一类。",
    "",
    "事件形状(与 CodeMUX Event 一致,只保留汇总器消费的字段):",
    "  { type: 'file_snapshot', file_path, original_content, is_new, tool_use_id }",
    "  { type: 'tool_started', tool_use_id, name, input }",
    "  { type: 'tool_finished', tool_use_id, is_error }",
    "  { type: 'user_message', content }        // 轮次边界",
    "  { type: 'turn_finished', outcome }       // 轮次收尾",
    "  { type: 'system_event', subtype: 'session_summary', diffs }   // 库中已有的产物事件",
    "",
    "toolNames 是工具名归一化的唯一别名表,两侧实现都从这里读,所以新增一个上游工具名",
    "只改这一处。canonical 取值:write(整文件写入) / edit(定位替换) / apply_patch(补丁)。",
    "写法规则:先 canonicalize(小写、'-' 与空格转 '_'、去掉 '()'),再查表;未命中用",
    "mutationPattern 兜底,但兜底命中的工具仍必须解析出文件路径才计入。"
  ],

  "toolNames": {
    "canonical": {
      "write": ["write", "write_file", "writefile", "write_to_file", "create_file", "save_file"],
      "edit": ["edit", "edit_file", "editfile", "update_file", "replace_in_file", "str_replace", "multiedit", "multi_edit", "batch_edit"],
      "apply_patch": ["apply_patch", "applypatch", "patch", "apply_diff"]
    },
    "mutationPattern": "^(write|edit|multi_?edit|apply[_\\s-]?patch|applypatch|patch|create_?file)$",
    "excluded": ["read", "read_file", "bash", "shell_command", "grep", "glob", "ls", "todowrite", "task", "webfetch", "websearch"]
  },

  "lineCases": [
    { "name": "empty-to-empty", "before": "", "after": "", "additions": 0, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "empty-to-one-line-no-trailing-nl", "before": "", "after": "a", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "empty-to-one-line-with-trailing-nl", "before": "", "after": "a\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "identical-single-line", "before": "a", "after": "a", "additions": 0, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "crlf-identical", "before": "a\r\nb\r\n", "after": "a\r\nb\r\n", "additions": 0, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "crlf-vs-lf-same-text", "before": "a\r\nb\r\n", "after": "a\nb\n", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2 },
    { "name": "lf-to-crlf", "before": "a\nb\n", "after": "a\r\nb\r\n", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2 },
    { "name": "append-line-no-trailing-nl", "before": "a\n", "after": "a\nb", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "append-line-with-trailing-nl", "before": "a\n", "after": "a\nb\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "append-blank-line", "before": "a\n", "after": "a\n\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "remove-blank-line", "before": "a\n\n", "after": "a\n", "additions": 0, "deletions": 1 },
    { "name": "append-two-blank-lines", "before": "a\n", "after": "a\n\n\n", "additions": 2, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "replace-middle-line", "before": "a\nb\nc\n", "after": "a\nB\nc\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1 },
    { "name": "only-newlines-append", "before": "\n", "after": "\n\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "bom-identical", "before": "\ufeffa\n", "after": "\ufeffa\n", "additions": 0, "deletions": 0 },

    { "$comment": "以下四条曾是两个实现分歧的根源:一侧把「文件末尾换行的有无」当成真实的行变更,另一侧不当。现在两侧统一为「不当成变更」。", "name": "add-trailing-nl-is-not-a-change", "before": "a", "after": "a\n", "additions": 0, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "remove-trailing-nl-is-not-a-change", "before": "a\n", "after": "a", "additions": 0, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "drop-trailing-nl-multiline-is-not-a-change", "before": "a\nb\n", "after": "a\nb", "additions": 0, "deletions": 0 },
    { "name": "keep-trailing-nl-with-content-change", "before": "a\nb\n", "after": "a\nB\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1 },
    { "name": "add-trailing-nl-with-content-change", "before": "a\nb", "after": "a\nB\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1 },

    { "$comment": "以下两条是两端一致但都「反直觉」的行为,刻意钉住以免被误当成 bug 顺手改掉。CRLF<->LF 整文件互转算全文件行数变更:Windows 上编辑器翻转一次换行符即触发。", "name": "crlf-to-lf-whole-file-counts-as-change", "before": "x\r\ny\r\nz\r\n", "after": "x\ny\nz\n", "additions": 3, "deletions": 3 },
    { "$comment": "尾随换行之外的空白是真实内容:BOM 之外的差异照常计入。", "name": "trailing-spaces-are-content", "before": "a \n", "after": "a\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1 }
  ],

  "eventCases": [
    {
      "$comment": "实时来源:运行时钩子已发出变更前快照。",
      "name": "edit-with-snapshot",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
        { "type": "file_snapshot", "file_path": "D:/project/demo/src/app.ts", "original_content": "old line\n", "is_new": false, "tool_use_id": "edit-1" },
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "edit-1", "name": "edit", "input": { "file_path": "src/app.ts", "old_string": "old line", "new_string": "new line" } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "edit-1", "is_error": false }
      ],
      "expectedDiffs": [
        { "file": "D:/project/demo/src/app.ts", "before": "old line\n", "after": "new line\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment": "实时来源:批量编辑,入参含多个编辑片段,无快照 —— 走退化基线。",
      "name": "batch-edit-without-snapshot-degraded-baseline",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "edit-batch", "name": "edit", "input": { "path": "src/batch.ts", "edits": [{ "oldText": "alpha", "newText": "ALPHA" }, { "oldText": "beta", "newText": "BETA" }] } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "edit-batch", "is_error": false }
      ],
      "expectedDiffs": [
        { "file": "D:/project/demo/src/batch.ts", "before": "alpha\nbeta", "after": "ALPHA\nBETA", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment": "同一文件在同一轮内被多次修改:只保留最后一次成功修改的结果。",
      "name": "same-file-twice-keeps-latest",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "write-1", "name": "write", "input": { "file_path": "src/app.ts", "content": "first\n" } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "write-1", "is_error": false },
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "write-2", "name": "write", "input": { "file_path": "src/app.ts", "content": "second\n" } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "write-2", "is_error": false }
      ],
      "expectedDiffs": [
        { "file": "D:/project/demo/src/app.ts", "before": "", "after": "second\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment": "失败或被拒绝的工具不计入产物。",
      "name": "failed-tool-is-excluded",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "write-fail", "name": "write", "input": { "file_path": "src/app.ts", "content": "nope\n" } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "write-fail", "is_error": true }
      ],
      "expectedDiffs": []
    },
    {
      "$comment": "读取类与终端类工具不产出产物条目。",
      "name": "non-mutation-tools-are-excluded",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "read-1", "name": "read", "input": { "file_path": "src/app.ts" } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "read-1", "is_error": false },
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "bash-1", "name": "bash", "input": { "command": "sed -i 's/a/b/' src/app.ts" } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "bash-1", "is_error": false }
      ],
      "expectedDiffs": []
    },
    {
      "$comment": "实时来源:补丁工具携带结构化的变更数组,每项带路径与差异文本。",
      "name": "patch-structured-changes-add-file",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "patch-1", "name": "apply_patch", "input": { "changes": [{ "path": "src/added.ts", "kind": "add", "diff": "brand new\n" }] } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "patch-1", "is_error": false }
      ],
      "expectedDiffs": [
        { "file": "D:/project/demo/src/added.ts", "after": "brand new\n", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment": "结构化变更数组的删除:删除后没有 after 内容,空侧省略而非发空串。",
      "name": "patch-structured-changes-delete-file",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
        { "type": "tool_started", "tool_use_id": "patch-del-2", "name": "apply_patch", "input": { "changes": [{ "path": "src/gone.ts", "kind": "delete", "diff": "old content\n" }] } },
        { "type": "tool_finished", "tool_use_id": "patch-del-2", "is_error": false }
      ],
      "expectedDiffs": [
        { "file": "D:/project/demo/src/gone.ts", "before": "old content\n", "additions": 0, "deletions": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment": "原生会话同步来源:补丁正文嵌在入参的嵌套字段里,相对路径按 cwd 解析。",
      "name": "patch-freeform-text-nested-in-input",
      "cwd": "D:/project/demo",
      "events": [
